Third-party data notice

The MIT License above covers the software in this repository — its source
code and documentation — and nothing else.

data/SP100.xls contains daily closing prices of the S&P 100 constituents,
the S&P 100 index level and the corresponding trading calendar, obtained from
Yahoo Finance (https://finance.yahoo.com). The file is bundled solely so that
the real-data experiment reported in the accompanying paper can be
reproduced. It is not covered by the MIT License, no rights in the data are
granted here, and it remains subject to the terms of its original provider.
Anyone redistributing or reusing the data must comply with those terms.
